{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sukoon-sanzen-sharjah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1366,"crm_id":"7120","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Sukoon","slug":"sukoon-sanzen-sharjah","display_address":"Al Tay East","building_type":["townhouse"],"completion_year":"TBA","developer":"Sanzen","price":2070000,"display_price":"2.07M","lattitude":25.22283708263,"longitude":55.601512269616,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":7,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sukoon is a gated villa community developed by Sanzen, designed around a philosophy of mindful living. The project features a limited collection of 854 villas, comprising town villas, corner villas, and standalone villas, with configurations ranging from <strong>3 to 7 bedrooms</strong>. Each residence is planned across spacious plots with private gardens, multiple floor layouts. Select homes feature rooftop spaces and private pools.</p><p>The community boasts landscaped green corridors and lagoon-style water features woven into the master plan. Architectural design focuses on minimalism and functional indoor–outdoor transitions, creating homes that balance privacy with community living.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_974b3cabb7.jpg","hash":"Feature_974b3cabb7","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_2ec8430fc0.jpg","hash":"Banner_2ec8430fc0","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_12_fa0c7420ba.jpg","hash":"Gallery_12_fa0c7420ba","name":"Gallery-12.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_10_4c7f3dbe12.jpg","hash":"Gallery_10_4c7f3dbe12","name":"Gallery-10.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazona