zen, the project reflects a clearly defined residential philosophy focused on wellness.</li><li>Villa-Only Gated Community - A fully gated development consisting exclusively of villas.</li><li>Diverse Unit Mix - Offers town villas, corner villas, and standalone villas with 3 to 7-bedroom configurations.</li><li>Wellness-Centered Planning - The master plan integrates landscaped corridors, pedestrian walkways, and lagoon-style water features, enhancing daily livability and strengthening long-term residential demand.</li><li>Flexible Payment Structure - A 40/60 payment plan reduces early capital exposure while aligning payments with construction progress.</li><li>Regional Connectivity Advantage - Strategic positioning within Sharjah offers access to major arterial roads, airports, educational institutions, and retail destinations without sacrificing residential tranquility.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1966,"cta":{"id":2783,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_a2fe166bfa.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_a2fe166bfa","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Set within a Growing Residential Zone","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Sukoon by Sanzen is positioned along Sharjah–Kalba Road, offering direct connectivity to major arterial routes including Emirates Road and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road. This placement allows residents to move efficiently across Sharjah and toward neighboring emirates while remaining distanced from high-traffic urban clusters. The location supports daily commuting without compromising the residential character of the community.</p><ul><li>10 minutes to Sharjah National Park</li><li>12 minutes to Safari Mall Sharjah</li><li>15 minutes to University of Sharjah